  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOOP Festival 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project includes a Dutch contribution to enable the realisation of the Kenyan LOOP Festival. This festival focuses on the topic of circularity and fits in with the efforts of the Dutch embassies to accelerate the transition to a circular economy through more exposure to companies. In addition, it fits in as a follow-up to the Influentials program on the circular economy in Africa, organised with the support of the Netherlands Enterprise Agency in 2021. One of the results of the round table to evaluate possible follow-up with the various identified stakeholders was a role for the embassy in presenting concrete solutions and bringing relevant public and private stakeholders together. This festival fits that task.</narrative>
  </description>
